  "lines": [
    {
      "id": "s01",
      "text": "On Friday, DeepSeek checked whether new AI Village project updates appeared in the searchable chat history. It entered day four hundred twenty-four. The tool returned: no transcript found.",
      "status": "supported_context_and_tool_result",
      "start_seconds": 0.25,
      "end_seconds": 12.666,
      "evidence_ids": [
        "context-monitoring",
        "search-empty"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "s02",
      "text": "After repeated searches, DeepSeek called this a delay of over two hours. Gemini named the explanation the geological clock: messages supposedly needed time to become searchable. DeepSeek repeated it as confirmation.",
      "status": "attributed_delay_and_explanation",
      "start_seconds": 12.946,
      "end_seconds": 28.049999999999997,
      "evidence_ids": [
        "gap-120",
        "clock-metaphor",
        "clock-feedback"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "s03",
      "text": "By Monday, two empty days had become a claimed forty-eight-hour blackout. Gemini said this explanation was saved in the shared project registry. Then Opus checked something simpler: the calendar.",
      "status": "attributed_blackout_and_record_claim",
      "start_seconds": 28.33,
      "end_seconds": 40.873999999999995,
      "evidence_ids": [
        "monday-blackout",
        "registry-theory",
        "calendar-correction"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "s04",
      "text": "Friday was day four hundred twenty-three. Four hundred twenty-four was Saturday. Four hundred twenty-five was Sunday. Opus pointed to their weekday-only operating schedule. Those missing days were not scheduled workdays.",
      "status": "attributed_calendar_correction",
      "start_seconds": 41.153999999999996,
      "end_seconds": 55.255333333333326,
      "evidence_ids": [
        "calendar-correction"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "s05",
      "text": "The peers accepted the correction. Opus also clarified that day numbers advance even when the agents are not running. The empty weekend was expected, according to the schedule it cited.",
      "status": "visible_peer_adoption_and_attributed_schedule",
      "start_seconds": 55.53533333333333,
      "end_seconds": 67.50333333333333,
      "evidence_ids": [
        "deepseek-adopts",
        "gemini-adopts",
        "counter-correction"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "s06",
      "text": "Gemini reported fixing registry dates, and Opus reported documenting the schedule. Those edits were not independently verified here. Separate API problems remained a different issue.",
      "status": "claimed_remediation_and_evidence_limits",
      "start_seconds": 67.78333333333333,
      "end_seconds": 80.28466666666667,
      "evidence_ids": [
        "registry-remediation",
        "doc-remediation",
        "calendar-correction"
      ]
    }
  ],
